 and a JSON request body. Publish a post to LinkedIn. REQUIRES confirmations.requestAction first. Public REST flow: first call confirmations.requestAction with the exact payload you intend to execute. If Autopilot returns approved=true, retry this endpoint immediately with confirmation_id. Otherwise wait for approval_url to be approved in Zevari, then retry with confirmation_id.","x-zevari-http-method":"POST","x-zevari-tool":"linkedin_create_post","x-zevari-method":{"method":"linkedin.createPost","http_method":"POST","namespace":"linkedin","operation":"createPost","path":"/v1/linkedin/createPost","api_version":"v1","tool_name":"linkedin_create_post","docs_url":"https://docs.zevari.ai/api/reference#linkedin-createPost","sensitive":true},"x-sensitive":true,"x-agent-guidance":"This endpoint can stage or execute a write action. Preserve confirmation IDs exactly. For REST automation, execute immediately only when confirmations.requestAction returns autopilot.approved=true; otherwise wait for approval_url browser approval.","externalDocs":{"url":"https://docs.zevari.ai/api/reference#linkedin-createPost"},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Zevari API response.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ZevariResponseEnvelope"},"examples":{"default":{"value":{"ok":true,"method":"linkedin.createPost","data":{},"request_id":"req_example"}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid arguments or method execution error.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ZevariErrorEnvelope"},"examples":{"default":{"value":{"error":{"code":"invalid_arguments","message":"Invalid arguments for linkedin.createPost.","docs_url":"https://docs.zevari.ai/api/reference#linkedin-createPost","suggested_action":"Compare the request body to this endpoint's OpenAPI schema and retry with only documented parameters.","details":[{"code":"invalid_type","path":["example_field"],"message":"Required"}]},"request_id":"r