iews, and email sends) from action_receipts, across channels, with action type, status, account, and time-range filters plus cursor pagination. Profile views dominate this history by volume, so pass action_type when the user asks about sends, replies, or engagement specifically. Use actions_list_for_lead for one person and actions_get_receipt for one action. Does not include inbound comments or DMs received. Planned campaign steps carry written_by (who composed the words: your_ai, zevari, or together) and sent_by: zevari. Zevari delivers every campaign message; delivery is not authorship.","x-zevari-http-method":"GET","x-zevari-tool":"leads_activity_feed","x-zevari-method":{"method":"leads.activityFeed","http_method":"GET","namespace":"leads","operation":"activityFeed","path":"/v1/leads/activityFeed","api_version":"v1","tool_name":"leads_activity_feed","docs_url":"https://docs.zevari.ai/api/reference#leads-activityFeed","sensitive":false},"x-sensitive":false,"x-agent-guidance":"Validate arguments against this schema before calling. If the API returns a docs_url, read that endpoint section before retrying.","externalDocs":{"url":"https://docs.zevari.ai/api/reference#leads-activityFeed"},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Zevari API response.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ZevariResponseEnvelope"},"examples":{"default":{"value":{"ok":true,"method":"leads.activityFeed","data":{},"request_id":"req_example"}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid arguments or method execution error.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ZevariErrorEnvelope"},"examples":{"default":{"value":{"error":{"code":"invalid_arguments","message":"Invalid arguments for leads.activityFeed.","docs_url":"https://docs.zevari.ai/api/reference#leads-activityFeed","suggested_action":"Compare the request body to this endpoint's OpenAPI schema and retry with only documented parameters.","details":[{